":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2017-11-03"},"0001048695-18-000031":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2018-11-21"},"0001048695-19-000034":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2019-11-15"},"0001048695-20-000041":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2020-11-19"},"0001048695-21-000044":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2021-11-16"},"0001048695-22-000033":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2022-11-15"},"0001048695-23-000039":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2023-11-14"},"0001048695-24-000185":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2024-11-18"},"0001048695-25-000157":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2025-11-25"},"0001048695-26-000077":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-K","filed":"2026-11-17"},"0001048695-25-000026":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-02-07"},"0001048695-25-000091":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-05-06"},"0001048695-25-000129":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-08-06"},"0001048695-26-000023":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-02-05"},"0001048695-26-000051":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-05-05"},"0001048695-26-000067":{"c":"FFIV","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-08-06"}},"finsights":{"FFIV":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $869 million in FY2026: operating cash flow of $959 million less capital spending of $90.5 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 25.4% of revenue. In FY2021 it was $615 million.","cites":["FFIV.ocf.2026","FFIV.capex.2026","FFIV.revenue.2026","FFIV.ocf.2021","FFIV.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $261 million in FY2026, 7.6% of revenue, against 9.3% in FY2021.","cites":["FFIV.sbc.2026","FFIV.revenue.2026","FFIV.sbc.2021","FFIV.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $601 million to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["FFIV.buybacks.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $917 million (the fiscal year less its first nine months: computed from two filed figures), up 13.3% from $810 million in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["FFIV.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FFIV.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.revenue.2024-10-01.2025-09-30","FFIV.d.revenue.2024-10-01.2025-06-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $3.4 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $818 million and net income to $722 million.","cites":["FFIV.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FFIV.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FFIV.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FFIV.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FFIV.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FFIV.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FFIV.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FFIV.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FFIV.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FFIV.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $869 million: operating cash flow of $959 million less capital spending of $90.5 million (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["FFIV.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FFIV.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","FFIV.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FFIV.d.capex.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FFIV.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","FFIV.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $2.2 billion at the end of FY2026, against $2 billion a year earlier. That is 64.4% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["FFIV.rpo.2026","FFIV.rpo.2025","FFIV.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $2.2 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $2 billion a year earlier.","cites":["FFIV.deferred.2026","FFIV.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 6,645 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $514,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["FFIV.q.employees","FFIV.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $7 million, after $25.5 million in FY2025.","cites":["FFIV.restructuring.2026","FFIV.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $1.6 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $0 in short-term investments. No debt is tagged under the tags read here.","cites":["FFIV.cash.2026","FFIV.sti.2026"]}]},"fin":{"FFIV":{}},"quotes":{"FFIV.q.employees":{"c":"FFIV","kind":"employees","n":6645,"quote":"As of September 30, 2026, we had 6,645 employees – over 99.8% of whom were full-time employees.","source":"FFIV-0001048695-26-000077","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-11-17","proof":"c880d5952bb5d14023a8bb441d21b10efccbe46e30d0ff5214e2cdc5e1f8d622"}}}